----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset (data/published/): licensed CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
The rows are public tender listings from tenders.etimad.sa, a Saudi government procurement portal. The authors do
not own that source text; it is public government information, and the CC BY 4.0 grant covers only our selection,
cleaning, splits and added labels (sector, kind). Attribute as: "Etimad tender titles dataset, derived from public
listings on tenders.etimad.sa". If the portal operator objects to redistribution, remove the affected rows.

Base model: UBC-NLP/MARBERTv2 (the model-hub card should be checked for its own license terms before relying on
the weights commercially; this repository does not relicense the base model).
